        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/c/e99b99/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2012-11-29T06:20:49.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>So back on October 31st I backed at the $190 level on the Shattered Timelines Kickstarter.&nbsp; I've added another $90 to ensure that I preorder Vengeance and an additional playmat.&nbsp; Tonight I was reviewing all the kickstarter items and noticed that somehow, my pledge is now at the $50 level.&nbsp; Of course, the 190 level is sold out.&nbsp; The only reason I pledged this amount truthfully was for the Wraith promo card, that (and young legacy) are all that I am missing.&nbsp; Now, due to something I am not sure how, I will be missing out on the Wraith promo card.&nbsp; I don't know what happened but am incredibly depressed over this.&nbsp; There is no reason for me to pledge the amount I've pledged because I already own everything SoTM related except for those two items.&nbsp; While I'm hoping this can be fixed I'm going to doubt it and say I'm probably screwed.&nbsp; No point in pledging the amount I have, so I'll be dropping my pledge down to about $70.</p>",
